{"path":"ranges/join_view/sentinel/operator_cmp","title":"operator==(ranges::join_view::iterator, ranges::join_view::sentinel)","titleHtml":"operator==<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">(ranges::join_view::<i>iterator</i>, ranges::join_view::<i>sentinel</i>)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/ranges/join_view/sentinel/operator_cmp","section":"ranges","kind":"page","summary":"Compares the underlying iterator of x with the underlying sentinel of y.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">friend</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">==</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*iterator*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Const<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> x, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*sentinel*/</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> y <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Compares the underlying iterator of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">x</span></code> with the underlying sentinel of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">y</span></code>.\n</p><p>This function  is not visible to ordinary <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/unqualified_lookup\">unqualified</a> or <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/qualified_lookup\">qualified lookup</a>, and can only be found by <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/adl\">argument-dependent lookup</a> when <code>join_view::<i>sentinel</i>&lt;Const&gt;</code> is an associated class of the arguments.\n</p><p>The <code>!=</code> operator is <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/default_comparisons#Other_defaulted_comparison_operators\">synthesized</a> from <code>operator==</code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> x\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/join_view/iterator\">iterator</a> to compare\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> y\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> sentinel to compare\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">x.<span class=\"me1\">current_</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> y.<span class=\"me1\">end_</span></span></code>, where <code><i>current_</i></code> denotes the underlying iterator, <code><i>end_</i></code> denotes the underlying sentinel.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"ranges","title":"Ranges library (since C++20)"},{"path":"ranges/join_view","title":"std::ranges::views::join, std::ranges::join_view"},{"path":"ranges/join_view/sentinel","title":"std::ranges::join_view<V>::sentinel"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"operator==(ranges::join_view::iterator, ranges::join_view::sentinel)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. Compares the underlying iterator of x with the underlying sentinel of y."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"x, y"},{"label":"Return value","note":"x.current_ == y.end_, where current_ denotes the underlying iterator, end_ denotes the underlying sentinel."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":94,"codeBlockCount":0}
